5. DYNAMIC SYSTEM PROPERTIES

5.1 STATE FIELDS

Each node has optional fields:

Field	Meaning

entropy	instability / uncertainty
weight	importance / system priority
velocity	rate of change
stability	persistence score
alignment	JARVIS goal coherence
visibility	TRON exposure level



---

5.2 GRAPH BEHAVIOR RULES

high entropy → fog state

high stability → landmark state

high velocity → migrating node cluster

low alignment → flagged by AEGIS



